<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Welcome to Jevah' }) %>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0a1f1c;">
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      border="0"
      style="background-color: #0a1f1c;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            class="email-shell"
            width="560"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            border="0"
            style="
              width: 560px;
              max-width: 560px;
              background-color: #0a1f1c;
              border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.22);
              border-radius: 16px;
              overflow: hidden;
            "
          >
            <%- include('partials/header') %>

            <tr>
              <td
                class="email-pad"
                style="
                  padding: 8px 48px 8px 48px;
                  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 1.7;
                  color: #e4ebe9;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hi <%= firstName %>,</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                  <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Welcome to Jevah. We’re glad you’re here.</strong>
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  Whether you share music, ministry, a podcast, a message, or your story — Jevah is a place for your voice to reach people who need to hear it.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  Your creator profile is ready. You can post your work, meet your listeners, and grow your community from here.
                </p>

                <% if (typeof optionalNote !== 'undefined' && optionalNote) { %>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
                    padding: 12px 14px;
                    background: #fff8e8;
                    border: 1px solid #f0d48a;
                    border-radius: 10px;
                    color: #3d2f0f;
                  "
                >
                  <%= optionalNote %>
                </p>
                <% } %>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                  <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Here’s what you can do next:</strong>
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  🎙️ <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Share your work</strong><br />
                  Upload a song, sermon, podcast, teaching, or anything you’ve made.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  🌍 <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Reach more people</strong><br />
                  Let people outside your usual circle find you on Jevah.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  💬 <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Build your community</strong><br />
                  Connect with the people who listen, watch, follow, and believe in what you do.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  🚀 <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Keep going</strong><br />
                  Show up, keep creating, and let the journey unfold.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #b8c4c1;">
                  When you’re ready, open Studio and add your first upload. People will be able to find you on Jevah.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="email-pad" style="padding: 16px 48px 8px 48px;" align="left">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 8px 0 16px 0;">
                  <tr>
                    <td bgcolor="#256E63" style="border-radius: 12px;">
                      <a
                        href="<%= studioUrl %>"
                        style="
                          display: inline-block;
                          padding: 12px 22px;
                          color: #ffffff;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          text-decoration: none;
                          font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                          font-size: 15px;
                        "
                      >
                        Open Studio
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                class="email-pad"
                style="
                  padding: 8px 48px 8px 48px;
                  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  line-height: 1.7;
                  color: #e4ebe9;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                  <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Your next chapter starts here.</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Welcome to Jevah, <%= firstName %>.</p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                  <strong style="color: #ffffff;">Create. Connect. Inspire.</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #b8c4c1;">The Jevah Team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
